1
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:06,220
You can show more than one chart at a time.

2
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:13,390
Pick how many charts you want on screen.

3
00:00:13,490 --> 00:00:17,250
Two by two gives you four charts.

4
00:00:17,350 --> 00:00:24,760
Linked is on, so picking an instrument changes every chart at once.

5
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:28,610
Click Linked to turn that off.

6
00:00:28,710 --> 00:00:35,440
Now click a chart to make it the active one.

7
00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:43,860
A new instrument opens only in the active chart.

8
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:47,210
Back to a single chart.

9
00:00:47,310 --> 00:00:50,430
The gear opens the chart's own settings.

10
00:00:50,530 --> 00:00:56,550
Here you can change the chart colours.

11
00:00:56,650 --> 00:01:06,760
New chart opens a chart in its own separate window.

